# GitHub secret scanning (thin trigger)

Before commits, pushes, or PRs that add credential-adjacent files, follow [`skills/`](../skills/) secret-scanning guidance and invoke MCP `run_secret_scanning` via `catalyst-github-secret-scanning` in [`.cursor/mcp.json`](../mcp.json).

- **Persona**: [`agents/security-hardener.md`](../agents/security-hardener.md)
- **Full triage tree** (session-only scan results, escalation, never echo secrets): extend in [`skills/devsecops-integration/SKILL.md`](../skills/devsecops-integration/SKILL.md) and project rule history — do not duplicate long protocol here.

Requires `${env:GITHUB_MCP_PAT}` (user env, not in repo).
